      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What are common LinkedIn lead-gen mistakes for Real Estate Developers + Brokers?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) Generic mass-outreach + spam templates (kills sender reputation + response rate). (2) Pitching immediately post-connection (violates LinkedIn norms). (3) Not using Sales Navigator (limits targeting precision). (4) No CRM integration (leads leak). (5) Weak InMail writing (marketing-speak vs peer-to-peer voice). (6) Ignoring LinkedIn algorithm signals (over-outreach triggers penalty). (7) No content foundation (profile without recent content = low reply rate). (8) English-only in India context — regional-language DMs get 30-50% higher response for Real Estate Developers + Brokers.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we measure LinkedIn lead-gen ROI?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Weekly KPIs: DM volume + qualified-lead rate + connection acceptance + InMail response + booked-meeting rate + CRM handoff quality. Monthly QBR: full funnel — DMs → SQLs → meetings → proposals → closed revenue → LinkedIn-attributed pipeline value. Quarterly: cohort LTV + LinkedIn-attributed customer revenue. For Developer, MD/CEO of real estate firm, Commercial Property Broker (CBRE/JLL/Colliers-tier), REIT founder, Real Estate Fund Manager, realistic: 2-3 months for meaningful attribution + 6-12 months for stable ROI + 12-24 months for major compounding via retargeting + brand-recall + repeat-inbound.</div>
